OL,5,G1210 Find It, Fix It, Flog It
OL,6,     FHenry Cole and Simon O'Brien get
OL,7,     Frevved up in Pembrokeshire, where
OL,8,     Fmechanic James's sheds are crammed
OL,9,     Fwith classic cars, motorbikes and
OL,10,     Ftractors, including a 1928 Model A
OL,11,     FFord.
OL,12,G1310 The Great House Giveaway
OL,13,     FSimon O'Brien gives Annie and
OL,14,     FSherri-Leigh the money to buy and
OL,15,     Frenovate a house in the Welsh
OL,16,     FValleys. And when they sell it,
OL,17,     Fthey get to keep any profit that
OL,18,     Fthey make.
